{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-binghatti-phantom","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"binghatti-phantom-jumeirah-village-circle","about":"Binghatti Phantom - an ultra luxurious project by Binghatti, located in the developed vibrant area of JVC. The complex is a 44-storey tower offering royal residences with private pools and a variety of one and three bedroom apartments.The complex has an amazing unique architecture. The tower has a circular shape, the facade designs combine traditional Middle Eastern and modern styles, and the panoramic windows and intertwining balconies with glass enclosures make the building a true work of art in the world of architecture. Only the highest quality materials are used in the interiors, giving each residence a luxurious yet cosy atmosphere.The four floors of the large podium contain a variety of world-class amenities that can provide residents with a comfortable space for entertainment and relaxation. The first four floors contain commercial spaces and resident parking, while on the roof of the podium, residents will find a large infinity pool with lounge areas, a tennis court, a children's playground with swimming pool, and numerous landscaped areas for recreation and leisure.Another feature of the complex is its favourable location. Circle Mall and the prestigious Gems British Academy are just 5 minutes away by car, while Al Khail Avenue Mall is 7 minutes away. Mall of Emirates, Dubai Marina and Burj Al Arab are all within 10 minutes' drive. Dubai City Centre, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 12 minutes away.","price":1000000,"title":"Binghatti Phantom","bitrix":{"id":422,"pf_id":"are.2.13602","source":null,"project_id":"Binghatti Phantom","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Binghatti Phantom","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Binghatti","project_location":"Jumeirah Village Circle"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3